1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,890
Jacinta: Hello, Easy Life Cleaning Services, Jacinta speaking.

2
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:08,540
Client: Oh hello. I'm looking for a cleaning service for my apartment

3
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,750
do you do domestic cleaning?

4
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:11,500
Jacinta: Sure.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,980
Client: Well, it's just a one-bedroom flat. Do you have a basic cleaning package?

6
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:22,799
Jacinta: Yes. For a one-bedroom flat we're probably looking at about two hours for a clean.

7
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,600
So we'd do a thorough clean of all surfaces in each room

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,982
and polish them where necessary.

9
00:00:28,982 --> 00:00:30,800
Does your apartment have carpets?

10
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,790
Client: No, I don't have any, but the floor would need cleaning.

11
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:37,900
Jacinta: Of course - we'd do that in every room

12
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,940
And we'd do a thorough clean of the kitchen and bathroom.

13
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:41,650
Client: OK.

14
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:46,281
Jacinta: Then we have some additional services which you can request if you want -

15
00:00:46,281 --> 00:00:50,250
so for example, we can clean your oven for you every week.

16
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:54,830
Client: Actually, I hardly ever use that, but can you do the fridge?

17
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:57,630
Jacinta: Sure. Would you like that done every week?

18
00:00:57,630 --> 00:01:03,470
Client: Yes, definitely. And would ironing clothes be an additional service you can do?

19
00:01:03,470 --> 00:01:04,730
Jacinta: Yes, of course.

20
00:01:04,730 --> 00:01:08,240
Client: It wouldn't be much, just my shirts for work that week.

21
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:12,550
Jacinta: That's fine. And we could also clean your microwave if you want.

22
00:01:12,550 --> 00:01:16,680
Client: No, I wipe that out pretty regularly so there's no need for that.

23
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:22,566
Jacinta: We also offer additional services that you might want a bit less often, say every month.

24
00:01:22,566 --> 00:01:27,760
So for example, if the inside of your windows need cleaning, we could do that.

25
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:31,352
Client: Yes, that'd be good. I'm on the fifteenth floor,

26
00:01:31,352 --> 00:01:34,480
so the outside gets done regularly by specialists

27
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:37,100
but the inside does get a bit grubby.

28
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:40,680
Jacinta: And we could arrange for your curtains to get cleaned if necessary.

29
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:45,270
Client: No, they're OK. But would you be able to do something about the balcony?

30
00:01:45,270 --> 00:01:48,420
It's quite small and I don't use it much

31
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:51,390
but it could do with a wash every month or so.

32
00:01:51,390 --> 00:01:55,700
Jacinta: Yes, we can get the pressure washer onto that.

33
00:01:55,700 --> 00:02:00,708
Jacinta: Now if you're interested, we do offer some other possibilities to do with general maintenance.

34
00:02:00,708 --> 00:02:06,028
For example, if you have a problem with water and you need a plumber in a hurry,

35
00:02:06,028 --> 00:02:10,723
we can put you in touch with a reliable one who can come out straightaway.

36
00:02:10,723 --> 00:02:13,540
And the same thing if you need an electrician.

37
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:15,460
Client: Right. That's good to know

38
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:20,500
I've only just moved here so I don't have any of those sorts of contacts.

39
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:23,640
Jacinta: And I don't know if this is of interest to you

40
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:27,109
but we also offer a special vacuum cleaning system

41
00:02:27,109 --> 00:02:34,033
which can improve the indoor air quality of your home by capturing up to 99% of all the dust in the air.

42
00:02:34,033 --> 00:02:37,810
So if you're troubled by allergies, this can make a big difference.

43
00:02:37,810 --> 00:02:42,898
Client: Right. In fact, I don't have that sort of problem, but I'll bear it in mind.

44
00:02:42,898 --> 00:02:46,190
Now can you tell me a bit about your cleaning staff?

45
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:49,647
Jacinta: Of course. So all our cleaners are very carefully selected.

46
00:02:49,647 --> 00:02:53,419
When they apply to us, they have to undergo a security check

47
00:02:53,419 --> 00:02:58,134
with the police to make sure they don't have any sort of criminal background, and,

48
00:02:58,134 --> 00:03:01,880
of course, they have to provide references as well

49
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,420
Then if we think they might be suitable for the job,

50
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:06,660
we give them training for it

51
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:11,020
That lasts for two weeks so it's very thorough, and at the end of it,

52
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:14,840
they have a test. If they pass that, we take them on

53
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,678
but we monitor them very carefully -

54
00:03:16,678 --> 00:03:22,000
we ask all our clients to complete a review of their performance after every visit

55
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,278
and to email it to us.

56
00:03:23,278 --> 00:03:27,050
So we can pick up any problems straightaway and deal with them.

57
00:03:27,050 --> 00:03:33,280
Client: OK, well that all sounds good. And will I always have the same cleaner?

58
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:38,170
Jacinta: Yes, we do our best to organise it that way, and we usually manage it.

59
00:03:38,170 --> 00:03:43,000
Client: Good. That's fine. Right, so I'd like to go ahead and...
